rname56", "created": 1789128868651, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "BornAgainAmerican", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "alphanews.org", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "https://media.scored.co/preview/1ATVCu3okU.png", "removal_source": "", "link": "https://alphanews.org/oakdale-man-knocked-unconscious-stomped-by-group-at-minnesota-state-fair/", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "45 year old Black Man who bumped into \u2018group of young men\u2019 at crowded MINNESOTA STATE FAIR gets beaten unconscious by \u2018light skinned African American males\u2019 according to his White fianc\u00e9. Minnesota police have not released any info on subjects. I wonder why.", "last_comment_created": 1789137762927, "content": "", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 7, "score_up": 74, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"description": "An Oakdale man suffered a broken jaw after he was knocked unconscious and stomped during an assault at the Minnesota State Fair.", "large_image": "nrH2jW53DInQvknE.png", "title": "Oakdale man knocked unconscious, stomped by group at Minnesota State Fair | AlphaNews.org"}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "text", "uuid": "1ATVCu45nY", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 59, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8829464, "raw_content": "I'll still be in line in November to vote for the GOP. But I can see the writing on the wall. Even with the SCOTUS ruling and redistricting wins we are going to lose anyway. \r\n\r\nWhat would have won the midterms is committing from day 1 to real mass deportations and using the military to facilitate that. I'm talking tanks rolling down the street and soldiers checking ID on every corner for 4 straight years until all 100m were deported. Bovino would have made the perfect Secretary of Homeland Security.\r\n\r\nOR we could have just delivered the lower energy prices, lower cost of living and no new wars that the campaign promised.\r\n\r\nEither of those options (or both) would have won the midterms easily..but instead we got...a Susie Wiles presidency.\r\n\r\nHope I'm wrong!\r\n\r\n", "author": "JoePlumber", "created": 1789132957746, "profile_picture": "WZEHyEIDoCvf", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "FauciOuchi", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "This Susie Wiles presidency is going to lose us the midterms. ", "last_comment_created": 1789141517605, "content": "<p>I'll still be in line in November to vote for the GOP. But I can see the writing on the wall. Even with the SCOTUS ruling and redistricting wins we are going to lose anyway.</p>\n<p>What would have won the midterms is committing from day 1 to real mass deportations and using the military to facilitate that. I'm talking tanks rolling down the street and soldiers checking ID on every corner for 4 straight years until all 100m were deported. Bovino would have made the perfect Secretary of Homeland Security.</p>\n<p>OR we could have just delivered the lower energy prices, lower cost of living and no new wars that the campaign promised.</p>\n<p>Either of those options (or both) would have won the midterms easily..but instead we got...a Susie Wiles presidency.</p>\n<p>Hope I'm wrong!</p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": fal